Dialogue: 1,0:00:05.28,0:00:06.55,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,540)\fad(160,220)}Yeah...
Dialogue: 1,0:00:08.52,0:00:10.55,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,540)\fad(160,220)}Purple satellites in the sky tonight...
Dialogue: 1,0:00:10.72,0:00:12.10,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,540)\fad(160,220)}Looking down on me...
Dialogue: 1,0:00:12.25,0:00:15.80,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,540)\fad(160,220)}I been searching for a sign...
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.40,0:00:28.66,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,540)\fad(160,220)}Purple satellites, floating through the night,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:28.66,0:00:31.88,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,540)\fad(160,220)}Watching all my dreams while I'm chasing city lights,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:32.38,0:00:35.16,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,540)\fad(160,220)}I been so far gone, trying to get my mind right,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:35.16,0:00:39.56,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,540)\fad(160,220)}Purple satellites, guide me through the night.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:41.56,0:00:44.72,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,540)\fad(160,220)}Purple satellites, tell me what you see,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:44.72,0:00:48.00,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,540)\fad(160,220)}Do you see the kid that I was meant to be?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:48.46,0:00:51.22,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,540)\fad(160,220)}Everybody changing, but I'm trying to stay me,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.22,0:00:57.24,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,540)\fad(160,220)}Purple satellites, keep watching over me.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.88,0:01:01.00,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,540)\fad(160,220)}Late nights, headlights, riding through the rain,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:01.00,0:01:04.28,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,540)\fad(160,220)}Thinking 'bout the days when nobody knew my name,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:04.28,0:01:07.46,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,540)\fad(160,220)}Had a lot of friends, now they're strangers in the frame,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:07.46,0:01:10.76,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,540)\fad(160,220)}Funny how success and pain kinda feel the same.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:10.76,0:01:14.16,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,540)\fad(160,220)}Looking out the window, stars dancing on the glass,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:14.16,0:01:17.24,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,540)\fad(160,220)}Trying not to think about how quickly time can pass,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:17.24,0:01:20.38,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,540)\fad(160,220)}Everybody moving fast, living for the flash,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:20.38,0:01:23.68,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,540)\fad(160,220)}I'm just trying to find a future that was built to last.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:23.68,0:01:26.90,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,540)\fad(160,220)}Got a heart full of scars and a pocket full of hope,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.90,0:01:30.12,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,540)\fad(160,220)}Had to learn to fly when I was hanging by a rope,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:30.12,0:01:33.36,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,540)\fad(160,220)}Every single setback taught me how to cope,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.36,0:01:36.66,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,540)\fad(160,220)}Now I'm looking at the sky whenever I feel broke.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:36.66,0:01:40.00,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,540)\fad(160,220)}Purple satellites, floating through the night,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:40.00,0:01:43.16,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,540)\fad(160,220)}Watching all my dreams while I'm chasing city lights,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:43.68,0:01:46.34,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,540)\fad(160,220)}I been so far gone, trying to get my mind right,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:46.34,0:01:50.94,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,540)\fad(160,220)}Purple satellites, guide me through the night.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.94,0:01:54.46,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,540)\fad(160,220)}I remember sleeping with anxiety and fear,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:54.46,0:01:57.68,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,540)\fad(160,220)}Now I'm in the spotlight but the darkness still appears,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:57.68,0:02:00.96,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,540)\fad(160,220)}Money can't erase all the memories and tears,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:00.96,0:02:04.10,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,540)\fad(160,220)}That's why I keep my family and my real ones near.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:04.10,0:02:07.10,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,540)\fad(160,220)}Everybody wants the shine but they don't know the cost,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:07.10,0:02:10.66,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,540)\fad(160,220)}How many nights I sat alone feeling lost,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:10.66,0:02:13.04,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,540)\fad(160,220)}How many bridges burned, how many lessons bought,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:13.64,0:02:16.70,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,540)\fad(160,220)}How many battles fought before I reached the top.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:16.70,0:02:19.60,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,540)\fad(160,220)}But I keep moving forward, never looking back,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:19.60,0:02:22.70,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,540)\fad(160,220)}Every closed door became another different path,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:22.70,0:02:25.88,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,540)\fad(160,220)}If tomorrow comes, I'll be grateful where I'm at,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:25.88,0:02:29.22,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,540)\fad(160,220)}If tomorrow doesn't come, tell my people that I laughed.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:31.08,0:02:32.44,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,540)\fad(160,220)}Purple satellites...
Dialogue: 1,0:02:33.70,0:02:35.50,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,540)\fad(160,220)}Can you hear me calling?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:36.40,0:02:38.68,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,540)\fad(160,220)}When the world gets cold...
Dialogue: 1,0:02:39.80,0:02:41.00,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,540)\fad(160,220)}Will you stop me from falling?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:41.48,0:02:44.66,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,540)\fad(160,220)}Now I'm on the rooftop watching dawn arrive,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:44.66,0:02:47.74,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,540)\fad(160,220)}Thinking how a dream somehow became my life,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:47.74,0:02:51.04,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,540)\fad(160,220)}Still got imperfections, still got things to fight,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:51.04,0:02:54.08,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,540)\fad(160,220)}Still got faith that everything will be alright.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:54.08,0:02:57.40,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,540)\fad(160,220)}If you feel alone, put your eyes into the sky,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:57.40,0:03:00.56,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,540)\fad(160,220)}Every star's a reminder that you're meant to survive,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:00.56,0:03:03.84,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,540)\fad(160,220)}Every storm eventually runs out of time,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:03.84,0:03:06.94,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,540)\fad(160,220)}Every broken soul deserves another try.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:06.94,0:03:10.30,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,540)\fad(160,220)}So I lift my head high, let the past fade away,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:10.30,0:03:13.40,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,540)\fad(160,220)}Thankful for the nights that helped me see today,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:13.40,0:03:16.64,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,540)\fad(160,220)}Purple satellites, watching while I pray,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:17.30,0:03:19.86,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,540)\fad(160,220)}Guide me through tomorrow if I lose my way.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:19.86,0:03:23.12,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,540)\fad(160,220)}Purple satellites, floating through the night,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:23.12,0:03:26.32,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,540)\fad(160,220)}Watching all my dreams while I'm chasing city lights,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:26.32,0:03:29.56,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,540)\fad(160,220)}Even when I'm gone, shining from the skyline,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:29.56,0:03:33.92,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,540)\fad(160,220)}Purple satellites, everything's alright...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:38.48,0:03:41.74,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,540)\fad(160,220)}Everything's alright...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:44.00,0:03:46.52,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,540)\fad(160,220)}Purple satellites...
